{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)HVTCameraController(py)mediaTypes","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"HorizonSDK"}],"fragments":[{"text":"mediaTypes","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"deprecatedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecatedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecatedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"mediaTypes","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"mediaTypes","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK","doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraController"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"copy"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"NSArray<NSString *>","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mediaTypes","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Depending on the media types you assign to this property, the camera controller displays a dedicated interface for still images or movies, or a selection control that lets the user choose the camera interface. Before setting this property, check which media types are available by calling the availableMediaTypesForSourceType: class method."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you set this property to an empty array, or to an array in which none of the media types is available for the current source, the system throws an exception."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"By default, this property is set to the single value UTTypeImage.identifier, which designates the still camera interface.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Superseded by allowedContentTypes, which holds the same setting as UTType values.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraController\/mediaTypes","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/horizonsdk\/hvtcameracontroller\/mediatypes"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An array indicating the media types to be accessed by the media picker controller."}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework/documentation/HorizonSDK":{"url":"\/documentation\/horizonsdk","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Record leveled video and take leveled photos: horizontal no matter how the device is held."}],"title":"HorizonSDK","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework/documentation/HorizonSDK/HVTCameraController":{"url":"\/documentation\/horizonsdk\/hvtcameracontroller","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraController","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HVTCameraController"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The HVTCameraController operates exactly as the UIImagePickerController class of UIKit."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It manages customizable, system-supplied user interfaces for taking pictures and movies on supported devices for use in your app. A camera controller manages user interactions and delivers the results of those interactions to a delegate object."}],"title":"HVTCameraController","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework/documentation/HorizonSDK/HVTCameraController/mediaTypes":{"url":"\/documentation\/horizonsdk\/hvtcameracontroller\/mediatypes","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraController\/mediaTypes","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"mediaTypes"}],"abstract":[{"text":"An array indicating the media types to be accessed by the media picker controller.","type":"text"}],"title":"mediaTypes","deprecated":true,"kind":"symbol"}}}